---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const canonicalUrl = new URL("/about/", Astro.site).href;
---

<Layout
  title="About Us"
  description="Learn more about Gacha Countdown, a fan-made project by gacha players that tracks version updates, patch releases, and banner schedules for Genshin Impact, Honkai Star Rail, Wuthering Waves, Zenless Zone Zero, and more."
  url={canonicalUrl}
  canonical={canonicalUrl}
>
  <main id="main-content" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-100 mb-6 sm:mb-8">About Us</h1>

    <section class="mb-5 sm:mb-6 glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-2">Who We Are</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        Gacha Countdown is a fan-made project created by gacha game players for
        the community. We love live-service games, but keeping track of every
        version cycle, maintenance window, and banner deadline across multiple
        games can be exhausting. We built this site to solve that problem.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base mt-3">
        Every timer and date on this site is curated and verified by our small
        team of contributors. We are players first, which means we know which
        dates actually matter to you: when the servers go down, when a banner
        ends, and when the next version drops.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-5 sm:mb-6 glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-2">Our Mission</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        Our mission is simple: provide precise, always-up-to-date countdown
        timers so you never miss a patch, maintenance, or limited-time banner
        again. No clutter, no noise — just the live dates for the games you
        play, in English and Spanish.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-5 sm:mb-6 glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-2">How We Verify Dates</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        We cross-check official patch notes, maintenance notices, and publisher announcements before updating a timer. When a publisher has not announced a final time, the countdown is clearly treated as an estimate and regional differences may apply.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-5 sm:mb-6 glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-2">What We Offer</h2>
      <ul class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
        <li>Live version countdown timers for each supported game.</li>
        <li>Current and upcoming banner schedules (character and weapon warps).</li>
        <li>Upcoming release tracker for new games.</li>
        <li>Character guides curated from the community.</li>
        <li>Full support in English and Spanish (/es).</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-5 sm:mb-6 glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-2">Disclaimer</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        Gacha Countdown is a fan-made project and is not affiliated with,
        endorsed by, or sponsored by HoYoverse, Kuro Games, Hypergryph,
        Perfect World, or any game publisher. All game names, trademarks, and
        related imagery are property of their respective owners. We do not host
        or distribute any game content or files.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-5 sm:mb-6 glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-2">Get in Touch</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        Have feedback, a bug report, or a suggestion? Visit our{" "}
        <a href="/contact/" class="text-primary hover:text-primary/80 underline underline-offset-2">contact page</a>{" "}
        or open an issue on our GitHub repository. This project is open source,
        and we welcome contributors.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>